BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:🔄 🌫️ Rethinking who you are in partnership · until Nov 27
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260925
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260926
DTSTAMP:20260925T140316Z
UID:e411764b2685370265be9fe1@jentm1-arch.github.io/calendario-astral
DESCRIPTION:From March to November\, a slow fog settles over how you show 
 up in partnerships. Neptune brushes your Sun in house 7\, the area of comm
 itted relationships\, while moving through your house of community and dre
 ams. You may feel less sure of your role next to others\, or find your ide
 ntity blurring into shared goals and group projects. This isn't confusion 
 to fix — it's an invitation to soften rigid ideas about who you 'should'
  be as a partner. Let some certainty dissolve so something truer can surfa
 ce later.\n→ Where are you defining yourself through others instead of f
 rom within?\n\n— Technical detail: Neptune within orb of square your Sun
  natal (house 7) · exact: 28/04/26\, 19/09/26\n\n(until Nov 27)
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
