DESCRIPTION:This Full Moon lands in Aries\, lighting up the axis between y
 our house of community and dreams (Moon) and your house of creativity and 
 romance (Sun). It squares your natal Sun in house 7\, stirring the same te
 nsion you've felt lately between personal joy and partnership duty — thi
 s time asking for resolution\, not just awareness. Neptune sits close to t
 he Moon\, adding emotional haze around what you truly want from your circl
 e of friends versus what you create alone. Mars\, ruler of this Moon\, liv
 es in your fifth house natally and is now transiting your house of communi
 cation — meaning honest conversation is the key to clarity. Since this M
 oon closes the cycle begun at the New Moon of April 17th\, revisit what yo
 u intended then. What became real\, and what dissolved?\n→ Which dream h
 ave you been chasing for others instead of yourself?\n\n— Technical deta
 il: Full Moon · 3°37' Aries · house 11 · exact 26/09 17:49
