 service\, right where your natal Saturn and Pluto also live — an area al
 ready about deep commitment and intensity. Over the coming weeks\, expect 
 to revisit old patterns in how you give affection\, spend money\, or maint
 ain relationships through duty rather than desire. Nothing new should be f
 orced now\; this is a season for review\, not decisions.\n→ Where have y
 ou been giving more out of obligation than genuine want?\n\n— Technical 
 detail: Venus retrograde · 8°29' Scorpio · house 6 · 03/10 08:15
