DESCRIPTION:For about six weeks\, Venus moves backward from your house of 
 routines and health into your house of creativity and romance. This is a n
 atural pause to reconsider your values around love\, pleasure\, and what t
 ruly feels good to you — not a time to sign new commitments or make big 
 purchases. Old flames\, old projects\, or old financial habits may resurfa
 ce for a second look. Let it be reflective\, not reactive.\n→ What from 
 the past deserves a second\, more honest look?\n\n— Technical detail: Ve
 nus retrograde · 8°29' Scorpio → 22°51' Libra · house 6→5\n\n(unti
 l Nov 14)
