DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261011
DTSTAMP:20260925T140316Z
UID:61328e487336536f9733d32a@jentm1-arch.github.io/calendario-astral
DESCRIPTION:This New Moon in Libra falls in your house of creativity\, ple
 asure\, and romance\, conjunct your natal Mars — your drive and passion 
 — and trine your North Node\, the direction your soul is growing toward.
  Venus\, ruler of this Moon\, sits naturally in your house of routines\, l
 inking pleasure to daily discipline: what you create now needs both spark 
 and structure. This is fertile ground for starting something personally me
 aningful\, whether creative or romantic\, that also nudges you toward your
  bigger life path. Consider setting intentions like: 'I commit to making t
 ime weekly for a creative project I love\,' 'I commit to being emotionally
  honest in romance\,' or 'I commit to taking one bold step toward my long-
 term direction.' You'll revisit this at the Full Moon in Libra on March 22
 \, 2027.\n→ What would you create if you trusted your own desire fully?
 \n\n— Technical detail: New Moon · 17°21' Libra · house 5 · exact 10
 /10 16:50
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
