 gan at the New Moon of Oct 10 comes full circle. Reread the intention you 
 wrote: what has blossomed? what do you release? what do you adjust?\n\n—
  Planting seeds in creativity and romance\nThis New Moon in Libra falls in
  your house of creativity\, pleasure\, and romance\, conjunct your natal M
 ars — your drive and passion — and trine your North Node\, the directi
 on your soul is growing toward. Venus\, ruler of this Moon\, sits naturall
 y in your house of routines\, linking pleasure to daily discipline: what y
 ou create now needs both spark and structure. This is fertile ground for s
 tarting something personally meaningful\, whether creative or romantic\, t
 hat also nudges you toward your bigger life path. Consider setting intenti
 ons like: 'I commit to making time weekly for a creative project I love\,'
  'I commit to being emotionally honest in romance\,' or 'I commit to takin
 g one bold step toward my long-term direction.' You'll revisit this at the
  Full Moon in Libra on March 22\, 2027.\n→ What would you create if you 
 trusted your own desire fully?
